    },
    "data": {
      "merge": "<p>When you summon this Arcanum, choose a damage type: <strong>air</strong>, <strong>bolt</strong>, <strong>dark</strong>, <strong>earth</strong>, <strong>fire</strong>, or <strong>ice</strong>. Until this Arcanum is <strong>dismissed</strong>, each of your allies present on the scene has Resistance to the chosen damage type (you <strong>do not</strong> gain this Resistance).</p><hr><p><strong>Allies Gain:</strong> @EFFECT[pfu-tower-arcanum-air], @EFFECT[pfu-tower-arcanum-bolt], @EFFECT[pfu-tower-arcanum-dark], @EFFECT[pfu-tower-arcanum-earth], @EFFECT[pfu-tower-arcanum-fire], or @EFFECT[pfu-tower-arcanum-ice]</p>",
      "dismiss": "<p><strong>Judgment</strong>. Choose any number of creatures you can see: you deal 30 <strong>light</strong> damage to each of them. This damage ignores Resistances.</p><hr><p><strong>Targets Suffer:</strong> @DMG[30 light|ignore-resistances|]{Judgment Damage}</p>",
      "domains": "judgment, protection, sacrifice",
